      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Estonia imposes a 0% corporate income tax rate on all undistributed and reinvested profits. Corporate tax is deferred indefinitely until profits are distributed as dividends, at which point a tax rate of 20/80 (20% on the gross distribution amount, or 25% on the net distributed sum) applies."
