        Estonia’s e-Residency program allows remote entrepreneurs to incorporate an EU company with a 0% corporate income tax rate on retained and reinvested profits. Corporate tax of 20/80 (20% net) is triggered only upon dividend distribution. However, digital nomads must actively mitigate foreign Permanent Establishment (PE) risks in their physical countries of residence.
      </p>
    </div>

