          <ul class="text-xs text-slate-300 space-y-2 list-disc pl-4">
            <li><strong>Place of Effective Management (POEM):</strong> If the sole director and shareholder resides in Spain, Germany, or the UK and makes all daily strategic decisions from their desk, local tax authorities deem the company effectively managed locally.</li>
            <li><strong>Fixed Place of Business:</strong> Renting a dedicated desk or operating out of an owned home office for over 6 months triggers a local taxable branch.</li>
            <li><strong>Dependent Agent PE:</strong> A founder signing contracts and conducting client sales meetings physically inside a host country creates agency exposure.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">
